OL,3,GNEWSAMissed opportunities before
OL,4,Aex-footballer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has found missed
OL,7,Fopportunities contributed to the death
OL,8,Fof a former footballer who had
OL,9,FAlzheimer's disease.
OL,11,FEx-Southend and Cambridge United player
OL,12,FColin Flatt seriously injured himself
OL,13,Fand fell from height at Basildon
OL,14,FHospital in July 2021. He later
OL,15,Fdeveloped an infection and died that
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
