OL,3,GNEWSAMissed opportunities before
OL,4,Aex-footballer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis former partner, Melanie Leahy, who
OL,7,Fcampaigned for the Lampard Inquiry into
OL,8,Fmental health deaths in Essex, said she
OL,9,Fdid not want to hear that "lessons had
OL,10,Fbeen learnt" but wanted to know "who
OL,11,Fwould take responsibility".
OL,13,FMid and South Essex NHS Foundation
OL,14,FTrust (MSEFT) said it had already
OL,15,Fchanged how patients at risk of
OL,16,Fdelirium or confusion are monitored.
